    'A JsonMapper is auto-configured for working with JSON … defining an ObjectMapper bean is no longer sufficient.'
    'The JSON-specific spring.jackson.read.* and spring.jackson.write.* properties have moved beneath spring.jackson.json.read and spring.jackson.json.write'
